				\begin{document}$${\mathrm{B}}_{av}=\mathrm{max}({b}_{a+e-1,v+b-1})$$\end{document}Bav=max(ba+e-1,v+b-1)

The pooled feature matrix generated after using Eq. (15) is given below:\documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
