The Flatten layer converts the pooled feature map acquired in the previous step into a feature vector, ready for input into the final classification layer. Following the reshaping procedure21, the elements or features of the pooled feature matrix B are molded into a flattened vector, as seen below:16\documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
